ount":91,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"机器人可比人类尽职多了，发布了6分钟的推文，给我转发了800次\n\n人类有时候回个信息都要等一小时呢 https://t.co/KfHo1ejm3J","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1800833776807030901"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-06-11T06:53:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1800421038746149269"],"id":"1800421038746149269","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":55165,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":121},"text":"打算出一期高考填报志愿➕大学生活规划的专题space或者微信语音直播，仅限2024年高考生，性别不限❗️\n\n我都快被自己的母爱光辉感动哭了🤔","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1800421038746149269"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-06-10T06:19:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1800050202096898510"],"id":"1800050202096898510","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":54345,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"男人的发骚和发怒只在一瞬间。 https://t.co/oYW9nDrS7k","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1800050202096898510"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-06-10T05:57:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1800044522065563916"],"id":"1800044522065563916","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40814,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近我的推特账户遭到不知名人士买水军、机器人恶意刷流量，我的每条推文会在短短一分钟内被一两千次的转发、或者点赞，又或者曝光量瞬间上升至十几万，这严重影响了推特的正常算法，以及对我推文的正常投放曝光。\n\n虽然我已经在推特的Help","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1800044522065563916"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-06-10T01:04:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1799970823169876203"],"id":"1799970823169876203","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":220859,"like_count":465,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":56,"retweet_count":8},"text":"昨天教孩子背「小池」\n小荷才露尖尖角，早有蜻蜓立上头\n就想起拍过的这张照片\n可好像又没啥关联？ https://t.co/rYp9di5P0r","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1799970823169876203"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-06-09T04:39:58.000Z","edit_history_twee